docs {
  # Get My Invites
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/invites/getMyInvites`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Request)
  
  No request body required.
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil daftar undangan",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "peran": "Anggota",
        "status_invite": "pending",
        "createdAt": "2025-01-08T10:00:00.000Z",
        "proposal": {
          "id": "uuid",
          "judul": "Penelitian AI",
          "tipe_usulan": "penelitian"
        },
        "ketua": {
          "id": "uuid",
          "name": "Dr. Ahmad Fauzi",
          "email": "ahmad@univ.ac.id"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|  
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
}
